# the Chrome zip of a release record, which names the store's extension: it stays on the maintainer's
# computer, and the record's committed SHA256SUMS.txt pins it. The records up to 14.0.0 carried the
# bridge's files too; 16.0.0 removed the bridge (their SHA256SUMS.txt stay tracked).
release/*/beethoven-*-chrome.zip
release/*/bridge/*
!release/*/bridge/SHA256SUMS.txt
# the store kit's copy of that zip, and the kit's own zip that holds it (docs/store/PASTE.md)
release/*/store-kit/00-beethoven-*-chrome.zip
release/*/store-kit-*.zip
